  "doctrine": {
    "summary": "Vietnam People's Army: a large conscript force following an 'all-people's national defence' doctrine with deep reserves and militia, the 'four no's' policy (no alliances, no foreign bases, no siding with one country against another, no use of force in international relations) and a long combat legacy (wars with France, the US and China). Mostly Soviet-era equipment being modernised with Russian, Israeli, Korean and domestic (Viettel) systems; heavy focus on the Spratly garrisons and coastal defence.",
    "squad_size": 9,
    "fireteam": "Rifle squad of 9 with RPK/PKM and B41 (RPG-7). Game: 8 in four pairs.",
    "tactics": [
      "Layered defence of fortified islands and coastlines",
      "Jungle ambush and infiltration doctrine, strong fieldcraft",
      "Massed militia and reserves in defensive depth",
      "Domestic drones for spotting and munition drops (shown 2025)"
