  "notes": "Neutral mid-tier state (proposal). Vietnam hires discreetly for maritime/infrastructure security in the south_china_sea theatre, never sells gear. Real-world: Comprehensive Strategic Partnerships with China, Russia, India, Korea, Japan and the USA (2023); active reclamation in the Spratlys 2024-25. 80th anniversary parade 2 September 2025 displayed T-90SK, modernised T-54/55, XCB-01 IFV, BTR-60 and domestic drones.",
